       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. RUNCBACT04C.
      * Launcher emulating JCL  EXEC PGM=CBACT04C,PARM='YYYY-MM-DD'
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 PARM-AREA.
          05 PARM-LEN  PIC S9(04) COMP VALUE 10.
          05 PARM-DATA PIC X(10) VALUE SPACES.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           ACCEPT PARM-DATA FROM COMMAND-LINE
           CALL 'CBACT04C' USING PARM-AREA
           STOP RUN.
